  "contract": "POST /api/items/batch/quickmatch is admin-only; a non-admin gets 403, a body without libraryItemIds or whose ids match nothing gets 400, and an accepted batch gets 200 before processing. For each loaded item Scanner.quickMatchLibraryItem applies the provider match: empty detail fields are filled (and all are replaced with overrideDetails), an empty coverPath is filled (or replaced with overrideCover), and the response is immediate while the per-item work continues asynchronously.",
